Caption:

```text
Can you tell whether an ad was created by AI or a human? 👀

Apparently, most consumers can't.

A recent study found that while AI-generated ads looked just as convincing as human-made ones, they performed 14% worse on short-term sales potential and 17% worse on long-term brand equity.

That's quite a gap for work that looks perfectly acceptable.

And it raises an interesting question for marketing leaders: Are we becoming so impressed by how quickly AI produces work that we're spending less time questioning its effectiveness? 🤔

At Vajra Global, we're seeing AI change how our teams approach creative work. Some of the gains have been remarkable. But we've also encountered situations where experience, cultural understanding and human judgement made all the difference.

Our colleagues Rajesh Senthilvelavan, Gokul R and Priya Ramesh have brought their perspectives together in an article that examines what happens when speed becomes the measure of success.

They share what they've learnt, including a few experiences that might make you reconsider how you evaluate AI-generated work.

📖 𝐑𝐞𝐚𝐝 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐚𝐫𝐭𝐢𝐜𝐥𝐞: https://lnkd.in/gQUGvXAD

#AIinMarketing #CreativeJudgement #GenerativeAI #ThoughtLeadership #VajraGlobal
```

