Caption:

```text
🤔 Would you put an advertising budget behind ChatGPT today?

Eight months in, there is enough evidence to take the question seriously. There are already campaigns showing strong returns, but the results are far from uniform.

What makes 𝐂𝐡𝐚𝐭𝐆𝐏𝐓 𝐀𝐝𝐬 particularly interesting is the context behind the user's interaction. A person can arrive with a detailed problem, explain what they are trying to achieve and compare possible solutions before an ad even enters the picture. That creates a very different environment for performance marketing.

But there are practical questions marketers need to answer first.

Who can you reach? How much visibility do you get into intent? Which business models are likely to benefit? And how should you measure a channel where the click may be only the beginning of the journey? 💡 

Our SMEs Rajesh Senthilvelavan and Swetha Sitaraman break down what the early data tells us. Their article looks at who should consider a pilot, who may want to wait, and how to structure the test without betting the media budget on an unproven channel.

🔍 Worth a read before you decide where ChatGPT Ads belong in your mix.

𝐑𝐞𝐚𝐝 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐟𝐮𝐥𝐥 𝐚𝐫𝐭𝐢𝐜𝐥𝐞: https://lnkd.in/g6Ds5inQ

#ChatGPTAds #PaidMedia #PerformanceMarketing #AEO #DigitalMarketing #AI
```

