Caption:

```text
10 years. One journey. A bold new direction ahead!

Vajra Global celebrated Vajra Voyage 2026 at IIT Madras Research Park (IITMRP) on 19th April 2026. It was a reflection of how far we’ve come and where we’re headed next.

As we marked a decade of Vajra Global, the day was filled with moments that truly mattered:

✨ Leadership stories that brought our journey to life
✨ Honest reflections on the challenges, wins, and evolution
✨ A clear vision for the future: Going AI-native, growth-driven, and outcome-focused.
✨ Recognition of the people who made it all possible

Hearing Ganapathy Sankarabaaham and the leadership team share their experiences over the years, and more importantly, their conviction about the AI-native future, set the tone for what lies ahead.

What made it even more special?
Our remote team members joining in, meeting everyone in person, and turning connections into real relationships.

From conversations to celebrations, from memories to momentum, it was a day that captured the spirit of Vajra Global.

